name: Photo Cards — Hideout Furniture
author: Hardcoon
version: 0.3.1
description: 30 photo cards (independent 35% rotating-stash search drop, each number once per playthrough): 10 small (X3), 12 medium (X4), 8 large (X5). 30 unique archive photographs in mipmapped 1024x1024 BC1 textures and matching icons, standard-size native HUD inspection and shared furniture placement with a 2 mm rear spacer. Based on Photo Collection by Mad55 and Photo of a Loved One - Animated by Apathy_Knight.
